          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Reprint 2026-27"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.653,
            0.046,
            0.862,
            0.065
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Proportional Reasoning-1"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.087,
            0.808,
            0.127
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us find the quantity of sand and cement in the original mixture. The ratio is 3 : 1 and the total weight is 40 kg."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.129,
            0.57,
            0.156
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "So, the weight of sand is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{3}{(3 + 1)} \\times 40 = 30   kg ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.16,
            0.566,
            0.187
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The weight of cement is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{1}{(3 + 1)} \\times 40 = 10   kg ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.192,
            0.848,
            0.231
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The weight of sand is the same in the new mixture. It remains 30. But the new ratio of sand to cement is 5 : 2. So the question is,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.439,
            0.234,
            0.56,
            0.254
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_16_equation_6.jpg",
          "content": "5 : 2 : 3 0 : ?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.262,
            0.848,
            0.33
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "If the ratio is 5 : 2, then the second term is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{2}{5}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " times the first term. Since the new ratio is equivalent to 5 : 2, the second term in the new ratio should also be "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 2 } { 5 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " times of 30."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.443,
            0.334,
            0.557,
            0.361
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_16_equation_8.jpg",
          "content": "{ \\frac { 2 } { 5 } } \\times 3 0 = 1 2 ."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.362,
            0.847,
            0.399
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The new mixture should have 12 kg of cement if the ratio of sand to cement is to be 5 : 2."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.398,
            0.848,
            0.437
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "There is 10 kg of cement already. So, we need to add 2 kg of cement to the original mixture."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.447,
            0.147,
            0.473
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
